{
  "id": "A31",
  "goal": "E2E",
  "title": "More for the host: everyone muted, a camera or a screen stopped",
  "why": [
    "Follows A24 (an admin mutes or removes a member in the call). A meeting's host also mutes everyone at once and stops someone's camera or screen share, as Meet, Zoom and Teams allow (docs/plans/host-more.md).",
    "Each act is the room server's, recorded once done (record_room_act, 0060) as room.host_camera_off, room.host_screen_off or room.host_muted_all; only the person turns their device on again. Twice is the same as once, so no key."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1room~1people~1{identity}~1stop-camera",
      "value": {
        "post": {
          "operationId": "stopCameraInCall",
          "summary": "Stop a member's camera in the project's call: an admin only.",
          "tags": ["rooms"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "identity",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "description": "The member's actor id, their identity in the call.",
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            }
          ],
          "responses": {
            "204": {
              "description": "Done, or already so"
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not an admin of the project",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Their own call, or they aren't a member in the call",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "description": "No room server is configured, or it could not be reached",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
